# DSP v2 project memory

Use DSP before and after structural code changes.

- Search context: `pnpm dsp search "<task>"`
- Refactor safety: `pnpm dsp impact <file-or-uid>`
- Update graph: `pnpm dsp update --changed-only`
- Validate graph: `pnpm dsp validate`
- Plain-text memory export: `pnpm dsp export --format protocol`

Do not send full repositories to the model when a DSP context pack/search/impact result is sufficient.
